{"title":"银釭","summary":"","icon":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/19/75833613/6f4523505cb6659d62543b998fb7f5ed_1736872796917539316.png","contents":[{"name":"","text":"<p>★★★★ · 单手剑</p><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/19/75833613/6f4523505cb6659d62543b998fb7f5ed_262055871176700099.png\">"},{"name":"装备描述","text":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(172, 133, 86)\">精炼(1/2/3/4/5)阶</span></p><p><strong>翦霞照水<br> · 施放元素战技后的12秒内，元素精通提升(<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 151, 225)\">52/65/待更新/待更新/待更新</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">)</span>点。该效果至多叠加2层，每层持续时间独立计算。</strong></p><hr><p>璃月归藏三隐之一的「万象风角灵官」留下的长剑。传说为天降的秘银所锻，曾一剑斩断过流动的海水。</p><table><tbody><tr><th>冒险等阶限制：</th><td><p>无</p></td></tr><tr><th>获取途径：</th><td><p>参与活动「银翎溯月，玄鸟结璘」获得</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"},{"name":"成长数值","text":"<h3>1级</h3><table><tbody><tr><th>初始基础数值：</th><td><p>基础攻击力: 42</p><p>攻击力: 9.0%</p></td></tr><tr><th>平均每级提升：</th><td><p>基础攻击力: +3.53</p><p>攻击力: +0.36%</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"materials\"><span class=\"mat\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/01/13/183046623/f48c8df9a6b72a59aee3d4dcb463a1c6_807184263957630936.jpeg\"><span class=\"mat-name\">漆黑陨铁的一粒</span><span class=\"mat-num\">×3</span></span><span class=\"mat\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/db0dfd84e7aa2dd9f2b331e19d6e2072_1555753695015709182.png\"><span class=\"mat-name\">漆黑陨铁的一片</span><span class=\"mat-num\">×9</span></span><span class=\"mat\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/07/01/80410800/d8428bc5e3f70cff8a310b2ddee18887_4612042175026815045.png\"><span class=\"mat-name\">漆黑陨铁的一角</span><span class=\"mat-num\">×9</span></span><span class=\"mat\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/22/6381993/0f52ddaaa4cb5b199ac18c6ede6488df_4087850740504825348.png\"><span class=\"mat-name\">漆黑陨铁的一块</span><span class=\"mat-num\">×4</span></span><span class=\"mat\"><img src=\"https://uploadstat